put("### Institutional timing and construction")
put("Primary agency notices establish suspended OFLC processing during October 1–16, reopening October 17, and administrative treatment of October 1–18 receipts as October 18. Recovery included emailed certification copies and expedited originals. These procedures can shift recorded dates independently of actual filing behavior. The baseline projection was fixed before event-period regressions; receipt recoding is flagged, never inverted into an invented submission date. [Archived DOL notices](https://www.aila.org/aila-files/EFC46464-B9FD-4F44-BC5E-3D6F3C38D0D2/13122348.pdf?1697590280=); [House shutdown chronology](https://history.house.gov/Institution/Shutdown/Government-Shutdowns/).")
